      {
        "id": "p24-p2-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Construct a histogram and cumulative frequency polygon.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "Histogram heights in class order: $6,10,15,11,5,3$. Cumulative frequencies: $6,16,31,42,47,50$. See the graphs.",
          "worked": "Use class boundaries $-0.5,4.5,9.5,14.5,19.5,24.5,29.5$ for the whole-hour classes. The histogram has adjoining bars of width $5$ hours and heights $6,10,15,11,5,3$.\n\nThe running totals are $6$, $6+10=16$, $16+15=31$, $31+11=42$, $42+5=47$ and $47+3=50$. Plot $(-0.5,0)$ and the cumulative frequency at each upper class boundary. Join consecutive points with straight line segments.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p24-p2-histogram",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"histogramFill\",\"hex\":\"D4E8FF\",\"reason\":\"frequency bar area\"}],\"reference\":\"answer book PDF p. 91, p24-p2-histogram\"}\n\\definecolor{histogramFill}{HTML}{D4E8FF}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=2.1mm,y=2mm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\foreach \\l/\\r/\\h in {-0.5/4.5/6,4.5/9.5/10,9.5/14.5/15,14.5/19.5/11,19.5/24.5/5,24.5/29.5/3}{\\draw[line width=0.8pt] (\\l,0) rectangle (\\r,\\h);}\n\\draw[line width=0.5pt] (-0.5,17)--(-0.5,0)--(30.2,0);\n\\foreach \\x/\\row in {-0.5/-1.2,4.5/-5,9.5/-1.2,14.5/-5,19.5/-1.2,24.5/-5,29.5/-1.2}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (\\x,0)--(\\x,\\row) node[below,inner sep=1pt]{\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$\\x$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\foreach \\y in {0,4,8,12,16}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (-0.5,\\y)--++(-0.55,0) node[left,inner sep=1pt]{\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$\\y$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\node[below] at (14.5,-8.8) {Hours per week};\n\\node[rotate=90] at (-8,8) {Frequency};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
              "src": null,
              "widthMm": 88,
              "alt": "Mathematical diagram",
              "overlayOf": null,
              "transparent": false,
              "axes": null,
              "spec": {
                "sourcePage": 91,
                "sourceRegion": "Answer book, upper-left, 10F P2(a), upper graph",
                "description": "Frequency histogram of weekly hours. House blue fill and black axes. Explicit numerical class boundaries support median comparison.",
                "mathematics": "Six adjacent bars of width 5 from −0.5 to 29.5, with heights 6, 10, 15, 11, 5 and 3. Vertical ticks every 2.",
                "answerVisibility": "solution-only"
              },
              "derived": false,
              "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
            },
            {
              "id": "p24-p2-polygon",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"cumulativeFill\",\"hex\":\"D4E8FF\",\"reason\":\"cumulative columns\"},{\"name\":\"polygonBlue\",\"hex\":\"268CFF\",\"reason\":\"cumulative polygon distinct from columns\"}],\"reference\":\"answer book PDF p. 91, p24-p2-polygon\"}\n\\definecolor{cumulativeFill}{HTML}{D4E8FF}\n\\definecolor{polygonBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=2.1mm,y=0.61mm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\foreach \\l/\\r/\\h in {-0.5/4.5/6,4.5/9.5/16,9.5/14.5/31,14.5/19.5/42,19.5/24.5/47,24.5/29.5/50}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (\\l,0) rectangle (\\r,\\h);}\n\\draw[polygonBlue,line width=0.8pt] (-0.5,0)--(4.5,6)--(9.5,16)--(14.5,31)--(19.5,42)--(24.5,47)--(29.5,50);\n\\draw[line width=0.5pt] (-0.5,62)--(-0.5,0)--(30.2,0);\n\\foreach \\x/\\row in {-0.5/-2,4.5/-12,9.5/-2,14.5/-12,19.5/-2,24.5/-12,29.5/-2}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (\\x,0)--(\\x,\\row) node[below,inner sep=1pt]{\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$\\x$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\foreach \\y in {0,10,20,30,40,50,60}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (-0.5,\\y)--++(-0.55,0) node[left,inner sep=1pt]{\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$\\y$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\node[below] at (14.5,-24) {Hours per week};\n\\node[rotate=90] at (-6.5,30) {Cumulative frequency};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
              "src": null,
              "widthMm": 88,
